      <title>C语言-HelloWorld</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/09/C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80-HelloWorld/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/09/C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80-HelloWorld/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="总代码"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#总代码"></a> 总代码</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">int <span class="function"><span class="title">main</span></span>()</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;Hello World!\n&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">return</span> 0; </span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>注解：<br />#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;<br />表示该代码内引用头文件stdio.h的内容(相当于import package)<br />int main(){}<br />该代码的主窗口，让机器知道从这个地方开始读取与执行<br />printf(“Hello World!\n”);<br />打印内容<br />return 0;<br />返回0，如果是0,那么返回值为true，如果是1，那么返回值为false</p>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> C语言 </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>建站</title>
      <link href="/2026/10/08/%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%99/"/>
      <url>/2026/10/08/%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%99/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="教程网站"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#教程网站"></a> 教程网站</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">https://www.cnblogs.com/coder-Jason/p/15821938.html</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="hexo文档"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#hexo文档"></a> Hexo文档</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">https://hexo.io/zh-cn/docs/</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="使用主题reimu"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#使用主题reimu"></a> 使用主题reimu</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">https://github.com/D-Sketon/hexo-theme-reimu</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="用git连接github"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#用git连接github"></a> 用git连接github</h2><p>先在本地仓库目录下启动cmd或者git bash<br />创建连接信息</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git config --global user.name <span class="string">&quot;DimMeteor&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">git config --global user.email <span class="string">&quot;1592497663@qq.com&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>建立远程链接</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git remote add origin git@github.com:DimMeteor/Dim-blog</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>修改远程链接仓库</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git remote set-url origin git@github.com:DimMeteor/Dim-blog.git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>将仓库内容全部推入暂存区</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git add *</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>将嵌套仓库(引用了别的仓库)添加暂存权限(需重新推入)</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git submodule add https://github.com/D-Sketon/hexo-theme-reimu.git themes/reimu</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>将暂存区内容提交到header</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;代码提交信息&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>将暂存区内容提交到仓库</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git push origin master</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>git工作流示意图<br /><img src="https://www.runoob.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/trees.png" alt="git工作流示意图" /><br />图片来源:<a href="https://www.runoob.com/w3cnote/git-guide.html" title="Github的简明教程">菜鸟教程</a></p>]]></content>
      
      
      <categories>
          
          <category> 网页制作 </category>
          
      </categories>
      
      
